@startuml uml_sequence_counterfactual
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Patient (Marcus)" as Patient
participant "SPA Client (React/TS)" as SPA
participant "API Gateway (FastAPI)" as API
participant "Inference Controller" as Ctrl
participant "Counterfactual Solver" as Solver
participant "ML Engine" as ML
participant "PostgreSQL DB" as DB

Patient -> SPA: Drags Resting BP slider from 158 to 125 mmHg\n(or clicks "Calculate Optimal Target")
SPA -> SPA: Debounce input (150ms)\nLocks immutable attributes (Age, Sex, Anatomy)
SPA -> API: POST /api/v1/inference/{id}/counterfactual/simulate\nPayload: {target_bp: 125, modifiable_overrides: {...}}

API -> Ctrl: Authenticate patient ownership
Ctrl -> DB: Retrieve original assessment vector & inference record
DB -->> Ctrl: Original vector x

Ctrl -> Solver: solve_counterfactual(x, target_threshold=0.20, locks=[age, sex, ca, thal])
Solver -> Solver: Partition features into Immutable (delta=0) and Modifiable
Solver -> Solver: Clamp candidate values to physiological floors (BP >= 110, Chol >= 140)
Solver -> ML: Evaluate candidate perturbed vector P(x + delta)
ML -->> Solver: Perturbed risk probability P_new
Solver -> Solver: Minimize L1 normalized distance: D(x, x+delta) = sum(|delta_k| / MAD_k)
Solver -->> Ctrl: Optimal counterfactual solution (new_prob=0.21, feasibility='MODERATE', deltas)

opt User clicks "Save Counterfactual Target"
    Ctrl -> DB: INSERT INTO counterfactual_profiles (inference_id, target, achieved, deltas)
    DB -->> Ctrl: Persisted
end

Ctrl -->> API: Counterfactual payload
API -->> SPA: HTTP 200 OK (Projected Risk: 21%, Delta: -23%, Target Biomarkers)
SPA -->> Patient: Updates projected risk dial in real-time with green reduction badge (-23%)

@enduml
